  "rawCandidate" : "{\"plan\":{\"update\":\"replace\",\"text\":\"Play a low diamond and win South's ace, preserving DK as a stopper. Clubs are the main source: five club tricks with a 3–2 break give ten tricks alongside two diamonds, two hearts and SA. Cash CA and CK, following with dummy's small clubs, then lead a low club to CQ. If clubs divide 3–2, cash HK before returning to South with a heart to HA; cash the remaining winners for ten tricks. Against a 4–1 club break, the same three club rounds leave one opposing master club. After CQ, cash HK and cross to HA, then concede a fourth club to establish South's fifth. Preserve DK and SA until needed to regain the lead; four clubs, two diamonds, two hearts and one spade then supply nine tricks. Do not expend either remaining side-suit stopper unnecessarily before the club concession. If the first club reveals a 5–0 break, abandon the automatic club sequence and reassess directional club plays and possible extra major-suit tricks; nine tricks are then not assured.\"},\"selectedCard\":\"D3\",\"publicReason\":\"Play low and win in South, retaining the second diamond stopper while testing and establishing clubs.\"}",
  "rawReview" : "{\n  \"verdict\": \"revise\",\n  \"blockingFindings\": [\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Cashing both heart honors before conceding the fourth club can defeat the stated nine-trick route against a 4–1 club break.\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A legal layout is W: S void, H QJT985, D QJT, C JT95; E: S KQJT753, H 2, D 9742, C 3. After three club rounds and cashing HK and HA, West can win the fourth club and cash four hearts, giving the defense five tricks despite the preserved DK and SA. Instead, after CQ, lead a low heart directly to HA, retaining HK. Concede the fourth club with all three side suits still stopped; a heart return is won by HK, followed by a diamond to DK to reach South's established club.\",\n      \"requestedChange\": \"Replace the 4–1 continuation with a low heart to HA without first cashing HK. Explain how the preserved heart stopper and diamond\/spade entries permit control recovery and access to South's fifth club.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"advisorySuggestions\": []\n}",
